#: cabrizzio_cabinet/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "CABINET"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A handsome stranger with a modelesque beauty stands just a few feet away from you, posing with a hand in his hair as though he were in the middle of shooting a perfume ad."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The moment he lays eyes on you he lights up, drinking you in with a warm smile and warmer gaze."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/22
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ciao, beautiful! What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Beautiful? Are you talking about me?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not a whole lot right now."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Admiring you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah Amore, of course I'm talking about you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The contour of you, the shape... I would love nothing more than to paint you. Or sculpt you. Anything to continue looking at you!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Buono! I've got some ideas on how to pass the time."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You'll find, Amore, that I am more creative than Da Vinci..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah but of course. I am admirable in so many ways."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Tell me specifically, per favore. And then I might do the same for you..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That jacket, your shoulders, your smile."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a secret."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're making a fool of yourself."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You have excellent taste. You are a fresh pasta, a plump, juicy tomato, sweet and salty."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Tell me, one object of desire to another..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "So many of the best things are... keep your secrets, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I look forward to gently teasing them out of you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-1/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But ah, I rush! Patience, patience for us both."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am a lover, Amore! In love, we are all fools."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "When I was a but a bambino, my Mama would call me piccolo sciocco, such a fool I was. My antics did make her smile, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/c-2/23/c-2/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And there is nothing better than making someone smile."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, but first, I must introduce myself! The music of courtship has its cadence, after all. I am the one and only Cabrizzio!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/14
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Piacere di conoscerti."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bustanto combono to tio."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Il piacere e mio."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah hah ha hah ha!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ay, degno di nota! What a beautiful effort you are making to speak the language of a new friend."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Si si Amore, il piacere for certain will be yours..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Now that we are introduced, we must get to know each other, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Let us begin with a simple question, un aperitivo."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you, and so so much is contained within your answer, have a favorite flower?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I do in fact."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really, actually."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Tesoro bellissimo! Of course you do. A vibrant heart must have a love of nature!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Picture it. I will try to guess what it is!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah then Amore, we have a delicious game before us!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Think of any flower, perhaps a flower that has been significant in your life."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-1/c-7/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "With my remarkable sensitivity, I will guess what it is."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I see... mmm. Amore, what a rich and colorful mind you have!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is a pleasure to me to be inside your eyes, seeing all your nooks and your crannies..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, let's look less at the crannies, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have crannies?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course of course! I am sorry. Sometimes I am, how do you say, over-zealous."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/c-8/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "There is time for crannies later. And nooks."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, do you ever, Amore. And exquisite crannies they are!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-2/c-9/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And somewhere buried in one of them, like a golden treasure waiting to be found is this flower in your mind!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I see red. No! Not red. Amore, how specific you are! I do see red and also I see orange, the color of sunset..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I see blue, the color of the ocean at night or the sadness at the bottom of your eyes..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I see yellow and pink, the colors of the wings of le fate glimmering in the early morning light."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore, so powerful is your mind sending this vision to me, I can even smell this flower."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It's a little spicy. It's earthy and yet light. Smell is such a powerful sense, Amore. It is the sense that goes most directly to our memories and our hearts."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What a gift you give me, Amore, with this aroma..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/48
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You are thinking, your most favorite flower, is..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/56
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Uccello di Paradiso! The Bird of Paradise!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holy bouquets HOW DID YOU KNOW THAT?!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... that was beautiful... and also wrong..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I know nothing, Amore. I know only what you show me. And I am at your mercy. Thank you for the gift of your favorite flower."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok. Yeah, this is hot."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-10/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I need a minute. This got intense!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Mmm. Amore. We have just begun."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Hot, you say? We are only a gentle simmer. Our flavors will only deepen with time."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course, Amore. There is no rush. There is never a rush with things that are great quality."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I can tell you have much quality within you. It will be my pleasure to help it blossom."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-11/13
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh no! I have not guessed correctly?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-11/21
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore, what can I say? I am so sensitive, and so open I must have picked up something in the air around you, and it has led me astray."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-11/29
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This can mean only that I have not brought my full attention to you. And I have not truly focused on you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-11/37
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "For that, I offer my humblest apologies. You are deserving of all of me, Amore, and I shall not fail again."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-11/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Apology accepted. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-3/c-11/45/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's... it's really ok."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I feel I should tell you also. It may look as though I have something of a hard exterior. I have heard before, though not from lovers, that I can sometimes appear closed."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But let me assure you... nothing could be further from the truth! I am open, I take great pleasure in being so, open to the world, to experience! I am open to you, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Will you grant me another gift?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Will you share with me more about yourself? What do you love? What makes you cry? What inspires your passion?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm still recovering from the flower thing... maybe another time, though."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. Those are some big questions!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Another time. For you, I have all of the other times."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I love the big questions. I love the small questions. It is the finding out about each other, sharing your hearts that brings the spice and sweetness to life!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-4/c-13/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Might I suggest that we savor these questions over dinner?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Then we have a date."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A date. Hm. I'm actually not sure."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-5/c-14/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Bellissimo! La Buona Fortuna smiles on me today!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-5/c-14/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I'll be counting the minutes. I will await your pleasure, Amore!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-5/c-15/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Mmm, I see. Could this be an invitation for more flirtation, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-5/c-15/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And perhaps you are truly not sure. You are more of a delicious mystery to me either way, Amore. I am fascinated."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_intro/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ciao to you for this moment, mia stella nuova! Wherever you go now, take with you the passion of Cabrizzio!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore! Buongiorno!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I have been pacing the floor, imploring the gods for the moment when you would come to me again."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The sight of you still strikes breath from my lungs. I am suspended in the glow of your beauty!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I bet you say that to everyone."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not comfortable with compliments."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Not at all! How could I express such passion more than once. To express it now has both exhausted and exhilarated me... you are the only one, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh tesoro... is this true? If it is, there is now a tiny crack in my heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "To hear that you are unaccustomed to receiving praise for the perfect artwork of your presence... I must rectify this."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah Cabrizzio. Lentamente. Lentamente."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Sometimes, Amore, I rush forward without thinking. It happens when I ride my scooter, too; I shoot around the corners without thinking what could be on the other side."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It has got me in trouble many times."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/c-1/47
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "For this, as for all things, we have forever."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is bringing my heart such a warm feeling to see you. I am so excited you have arrived in time for our date!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That I am!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh god, I forgot about that... what were you thinking of doing?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Wonderful, Amore. Your excitement honors me!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh! How lovely. I shall tell you all about it. I want you to be prepared for the sensory feast we will create together!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "First, my zia Ventrina's restaurant for a perfect homemade meal in her garden. Her kitchen is heaven... fresh bread, sharp lemons... she is the best cook in all of Italia!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I cannot wait to see your experience of all these culinary sensations, Amore... what scent will you love? Which flavor will be brand new to you?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Which, perhaps, will make you cry or remember a lost love or a grief? Will your scents be the same as mine?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you like good food, Amore? Real Italian food?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, obviously?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "More of a Thai fan, but I can try something new."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know we're not in Italy right now, right?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, certo! Who could not love the food of love?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Once you have had a real Italian spice, you will never desire galangal again!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know what galangal is?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have to politely disagree with that! But onwards we go."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course I do! You had a little jar of it for many many... years, I think it was. I am quite familiar!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, Amore, I love how thoroughly you are yourself. Galangal forever!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, Amore, in our hearts, we are always in Italia!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "After we have reveled in the pleasure of Zia Ventrina's cooking, you shall meet my dearest friend... well, perhaps except for you, Amore..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...this is my scooter, Il Ragazzo Pazzo."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Together, the three of us will take the most beautiful road in all of Italia, from Ventrina's right down to the sparkling ocean. We will wind through mountains and fog and dazzling sunset light and we will park mere feet from the gently washing surf."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/30
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Have you ever ridden a scooter, Amore?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you kidding? I love it!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I haven't. And I'm totally in."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a cabinet. How does a cabinet ride a motorcycle?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I knew you would. For sure, I knew it. In my heart, I could feel the threads of simpatico weaving us ever more closely together!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you mean... this ride with me, the most beautiful ride on the most beautiful road in the most beautiful country in the world..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...this will be your first?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My first motorcycle ride, yes. Pump the brakes, Casanova."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You may be my first for many things, Cabrizzio."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, but mi piccolo sciocco... one does not pump the brakes on Il Ragazzo Pazzo... one just gives them a gentle squeeze..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah it is a jest, Amore, of course of course. Think of this ride as only the best tour of the Italian coast that has ever been!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Nothing more, io prometto."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And you mine, Amore..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...it is without question the first time I have beheld a beauty that so illuminates the world, in body and in spirit."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Con fede, Amore! With faith and passion I ride, as I do all things."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Besides, Il Ragazzo Pazzo would ride himself to take in the scene I will show you!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "On this beach, a very special beach, behind a little outcropping of sea rocks is a tiny bar."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "At this tiny bar there are three stools and two tables for two. I have reserved one of them for us, Amore, the one that bathes in the light of the setting sun and washes itself in a warm salt breeze."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "To this table, our paradiso, will be brought a bottle of the best limoncello you have ever tasted."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Have you ever tried that sweet, tangy gift that is Italian limoncello?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have! It's delicious!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never. You're making this sound so incredible."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have... didn't like it much... sorry!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Delicious! La parola perfetta."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I confess, Amore... I am having a fantasy of you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I would like to dip just the tip of your finger into a tiny glass of liquid sunshine and catch the drop that fell from it on my tongue..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That. Let's do that."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are too much! Let's just drink the damn stuff for now, OK?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah we will, Amore... we will..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Certo! Yes."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do get carried away... I am in love with love! I am in love with romance! Ah forgive me, Amore, please. We will sip as companions. Limoncello is tasty even without dipping the fingers."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is. It truly is!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Never apologize, Amore! Your tastes are your tastes, you are unique and wonderful! Thank you for telling me the truth."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This limoncello truly is exquisite, should you desire to try it again... but if not, they also have a few wonderful wines that the owner bottles in his own vigneto."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This is Italia, after all!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "So. With a humble flourish, I finish. That is the date, the romantic flight I propose to you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is an embodiment of my love, how I love, what I love. I love love, truthfully. It is my great honor to offer my love to you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Tell me, Amore. What do you think and feel about love?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel I love how hot you look on Il Ragazzo Pazzo."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still confused how I can do any of this stuff with a cabinet...?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's special. Not easy, but special."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Meh. Me and love haven't really gotten along in the past."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-14/13
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Believe it is possible, Amore, and it will be so!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-14/21
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This is some of my greatest wisdom... the power of belief."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-14/29
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You have such a streak of disbelief in you, Amore... is there some reason? Is there something in your past that has hardened your heart?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-14/37
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I can easily understand this. We protect ourselves this way, con un involucro, a shell. We become like the clams and keep our hearts hidden inside, away from the harshness of the world."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-14/45
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Love can be the most frightening call of all, Amore, daring us to emerge. But it is truly the freedom we seek."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I agree. There is something special about it that goes beyond words."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Is it possible you have not experienced a true love yet, Amore?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It sounds to me that perhaps love has brought you pain before."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But this is so personal. Perhaps too personal. I mean never to pry, Amore. I am honored by what you choose to tell me, when you're ready..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "We must all be allowed our privacy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It has been my experience that the past is a sacred road; when we tread upon it, we must go reverently, if at all."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah Amore, I am just talking now! What shall we do? It is up to you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We can talk a little more."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Lovely, Amore. I have a little question for you. Another opportunity for us to know each other."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you have a favorite season?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Spring."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Summer."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fall."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Winter."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The time of flowers and life. I find Spring to be romantic and wistful."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, perfection! When the sun shines high overhead and the land is ripe with delicious and sweet fruit. When the best wine is made!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This season is my favorite, also. I crave the smell of the ocean, the warm wind, the sweet smells of grapes being crushed into juice."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The trees changing their leaves, the crisp wind on the air. Riding a scooter in the fall is like falling in love."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/23/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I love when snow settles and the world turns bright and soft."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Thank you for sharing! It is but a little thing, una piccola cosa. But the little things add up to create a knowing. Don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go on the date!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna just go, I think."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/c-18/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course! The date! Ah, Amore, what a wonderful adventurous spirit you have."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/c-18/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Next time... I will be ready."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/c-19/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "....ah."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/c-19/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I hope I have not offended you, Amore... this departure feels hasty. And I mean nothing, nothing at all but that your presence will be missed."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-6/c-19/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I hope in our time apart you can rest and smile and be happy... you deserve it fully. I will pine... only a little, io prometto, but I shall. I have grown so fond of you, you see."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "To spend this time with you, Amore, has been a dream and a joy. I can only wish there will be more chances!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know yet."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/c-20/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Bellissimo! Whenever the moment calls to you, whenever you can feel a gentle hand urging you toward companionship, pleasure, sensation, Amore..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/c-20/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You know just where I am!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/c-21/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Mmmm more of your delectable indecision. It is with tingling anticipation that I await your choice!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/c-21/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Somehow, with you, even the pain of not knowing is a pleasure!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/c-22/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/firstdateend/c-22/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I may yet hope. In the dark corners of our own souls, may we all find space to hope."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_encounter/0/g-7/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ciao!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I think often, at night, about love."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The way the stars shine down, the glitter like the sparks in my chest when someone I desire... when you come near me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sparks?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure what you mean."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Si! Floating electricity."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, but you are, Amore. I will tell it to you again."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will tell it to you a thousand ways just for the pleasure of speaking these words aloud before you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The night sky, il firmamento."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is vast and close."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, I can hear myself... sometimes when I catch myself in the throes of my poetry... Amore, I hope I have not embarrassed you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all, are you kidding? You're really talented!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not embarrassed. You just express yourself so freely."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah Amore! The smile you create! Look at the sunbeams pouring out of my face now!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean it."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you write poetry AND ride Il Ragazzo Pazzo, though."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Well. Perhaps now you can see how much I mean all the love and affection I give to you! If you can mean it to me, I surely can mean it to you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will be the sun and you the moon, until the light eclipses mine."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "We shall trade positions in the heavens to reflect each other in the patient dance for all time!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You and the heavens... you are inspiring my poetry..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah! Amore. You have hit upon two of my deepest passions... surely they can exist together. For what is a night ride through a Roma tranquilla if not a poem in motion?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Just to see the cool liquid moonlight reflected on those ancient stones..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "That I do. This freedom of expression to me is essential. Where would we be, for example, if the sun felt he had to hide his face so as not to burn us?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Or the moon turned her cool benevolence away in order not to shame the stars?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah! We come to another question, Amore, an important one. I put it to you lovingly..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If you had to choose, and what a choice to make, Amore! Between the sun and the moon, whom would you choose?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The sun."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The moon."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The sun! Si. So warm, lights the world and feeds the growing things."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It shows us the beauty all around... and yet, it can destroy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Life is always in balance, is it not, Amore? Destruction and creation, danger and vitality all at once, love and death, dancing."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The moon! Of course. Her gentle mystery, her undeniable power."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "How could we not feel the fascination of her movements through presence and absence?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "How could we not treasure the quietude she demands, the fertile slumber she looks on so cooly?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-1/c-5/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The light of the moon, Amore, lights up less what is around us than that which is within us."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh Amore. You have truly unlocked my heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But I fear I may be sharing more than you wish to hold. Have you had your fill of poetry for now?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do love listening to you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I shall ramble and ponder on my own for a while then."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-6/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Arrivederci, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I love listening to you, too."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What a gift to find this openness, no? It is a rare thing. A diamond."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What luck for me, then, to find not only that the diamond but the setting, too, is extraordinary."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/34
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I trust I shall see you again soon, Amore? I find I need a moment to savor the world as I have known it..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/42
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...before I fall completely under your spell and am drowned in you, forever."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will see you soon. Without question."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's keep the drowning to a minimum... but we can keep talking."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Bellissimo! Arrivederci, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_love/0/g-2/c-7/50/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, of course. I will not drown in you, then. I will keep my head above water, with yours. We can float together on the pale green sea."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Mmmhmm! That could be the hot thrumming of that little engine between my doors."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But that isn't what you mean, truly, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ay Amore! Of course the heat we feel is the attraction budding between us."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is the candle on the red and white table cloth that is growing, flaring. It becomes a bonfire that reflects in the wine and in your sparkling eyes!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And Amore... my eyes behold you through the roaring candle... and mi piace quello que vedono."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/43
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "In bella Italia, that means \"I like what they see.\""
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow... are you always this complimentary?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh my goodness. I would so love to be across that table from you right now."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am Cabrizzio. I have space in my heart for so much love."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But I am also Cabrizzio. I am proud. I am honest. I hold in me only that which is pure and wholesome and I give that back out as well."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am complimentary... when it is earned, and when it is truthful."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "In your case, Amore, yes. I will always be this complimentary."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "We can arrange that, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Anything is possible for those who are guided by love!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Now tell me. You have heard the date I have planned for us, we are already staring at each other through the flames of desire..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...what would you talk about now? Tell me, Amore, what would you have me say? What can I offer you to enflame your heart, to please your gentle ears?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just keep being you... a bad boy with a soft heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can tell me how you got such impressive arms."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keep on being excited by me. I love it."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "How could it be you have divined my innermost self with such accuracy? You are truly the archer, il dio Apollo, with a shaft aimed at my very centro!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What a joy to be so understood. To be so undone and remade by love!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/34
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Say you'll go on another date with me, Amore. Relieve my suffering and consent!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I will! I thought you'd never ask."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah... I'mma let you stew for a little while. Miss me..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah tease and torture! To have a single bite of cake and long, crave, pine for the next, poised on the fork of a cruel lover."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-2/42/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is the sweetest torment I know."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do heavy work, Amore. I hold many things."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is to my great honor that they are all things you have given me to hold. Without question and without complaint. I do this because I have found that the burden you ask is no burden at all..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...tempered as it is by your grace and beauty."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "In fact, as such an experienced holder of things, I should quite like to try these arms at holding you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh... I'd like that very much."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you for the offer, but I'm alright."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Meraviglioso, Amore. Thank you for your trust. And for your sense of adventure. These arms are safe, but they can whisk you away to parts unknown, territories unexplored..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...would you like that?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. Yep."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe on our next date?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Hm. What a bold one, you are."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is my pleasure! I shall offer again. I hope you continue to honor me with honesty."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Like a lovesick warrior on siege, I wait without the walls."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You could not have said anything that would have pleased me more deeply than this!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah my lover, my friend, my inspired breath! The ways you excite me cannot be counted, cannot be measured."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am enlivened by your presence, I am awakened by your notice and grown to the stature of a god by the gift of your smile upon me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Even when you walk away, Amore, there is more pleasure to be had... your gait holds the allure of a champion pacing the grounds, a monarch in the pavilion, spotlit by the very heavens themselves."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're going on another date, right? Say yes."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On that note, I'm going to go and feel great about myself for a while."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. I guess you do always talk like that."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "As though any force in heaven or earth could stop me!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It will be the pleasure of my existence thus far to take you for another romantic fairy ride."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I could ask for nothing more, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Go. Revel in yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do. I have, I do and I will, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/g-0/c-4/39/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Come back to me should you like another dose of fine romantic conversation!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_first_flirty/0/nextdate/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "In the meantime, Amore, I will dream of you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Buongiorno!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is so wonderful to see you again!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Tell me, come stai? How are you?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm talking to you, so I'm wonderful!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Meh. I'm alright."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not good."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Eccellente!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You are all right. All about you is right."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "All about you is just as it should be, perfection, and a pleasure to behold."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ay, Amore. Let us be sad, while we must be sad. But let us remember, too, that joy is the base of all things. Even the sadness itself."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I was just thinking that today is a beautiful day to smile."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And then, here you are. I cannot help but smile to see you... I am truly aligned with the will of the gods, it seems."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping to learn a little more about you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good for you. I don't usually feel that way."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh, is that right?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am tickled by your curiosity! I have always loved this phrase, tickled. And it is truly how I feel! I giggle and twist in the warm light of your interest."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Cabrizzio?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are things you like?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about your past."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am what you see! I am an open book, Amore. You know me already!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "A handsome cabinet with a passion for Il Ragazzo Pazzo and the curves of your body."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Surely you aren't dissatisfied with me already? This sexy, jacketed being before you?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No no, just want some little details."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So secretive!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all! Your sexiness is fantastic."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Then ask! Anything for you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Coffee or tea?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you like yoga?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Red wine or white?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "A strong cup of coffee. Espresso. With a little lemon, un po' de limone."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Served across a romantic table from you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You are the most satisfying drink of all."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course! Anything that keeps me fit, limber and ready to make love to you, Amore..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Whichever type I can pour into a glass held by you, whichever type you will bring to your lips and savor as your eyes flutter closed and you relax into the presence of love."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Secrets are healthy, Amore! We all deserve some secrets."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But I am much more open than secretive. Look how well you already know me, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You have met Il Ragazzo Pazzo! Indeed, there is too much beauty to keep any of it hidden away."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Out! Into the air! To breathe!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like that about you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Grazie! I think it's important to be passionate in life."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "There are so many beautiful things to experience."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-1/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And what better way to embrace that beauty than passionately?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course it is. I would say I have worked very hard to cultivate a certain appearance..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...and it would be true, so I will say it."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-2/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Hahaha, Amore! Did you imagine I was about to lie and say that this was all \"natural\"?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/31/c-2/34
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "No no. We are all our own masterpieces, I believe."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah but the list would use all the breath I have left in me! If I were to tell it all to you, I should never stop talking. Here are just a few in my mind..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I like flowers, good wine, the summer sun, the wind on my face."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I like you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you, too."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Woah, slow down. I like you, as a friend."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I cannot tell you how much this makes my heart sing."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Lentamente, yes, lentamente. I do have to remind myself of this from time to time... no need to go careening around those corners, after all!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And your friendship is indeed a treasure."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We've only known each other for a little while."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's just a little much. I'm uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course, Amore, you are right. You are so very right. Thank you for this."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am the first one to say slow down and take in the flowers."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But I also know my heart and it speaks truthfully."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I was only speaking the truth from my heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But lentamente, si, si."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/31/c-1/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Perhaps we play a game? It is an easy one... just a way to share with each other."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah... I am afraid that might bore you, Amore. There are so many more beautiful things we could be sharing!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you hiding?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you embarrassed?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Speaking of sharing beautiful things... what do you have underneath that jacket?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Hiding? No! I hide nothing. I am an open book, I am truthfulness itself, I..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh, Amore, your guileless face has prised me open. There are things in my past that..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...they bring me so much pain. They reopen the cracks that have not yet sealed and at times, I cannot bear it."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do not mean to hide. It looks that way, I know... but I have found release, I have found pleasure and... if I dare admit it... escape in living in this moment. Proprio adesso."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "No, of course not. It is not embarrassment, Amore. It is..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...pain."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "There was someone, once... someone I was very close to."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Look at me talking about the very thing I didn't want to."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore, spare me, please. You know I can deny you nothing."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/47
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If you demand it of me, I will tell it all and I cannot bear it. Have mercy. Release me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok, Cabrizzio. Let's move on."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sometimes it's very healing to talk about the things that hurt."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Grazie!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You are so wise. And I can hear your compassion..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-1/55/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But I cannot, Amore. Please, understand."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This jacket? My jacket. I..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Underneath this is my body."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I've been thinking so much lately of changing my look!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If it pleases you - I would undress and show you what I have been working with."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/42
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will not undress here... but later, when it is time."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I'll have to hold you to that promise then!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's okay... I just wanted to ask."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/50/c-0/13
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Bellissimo! Perfetto. Grazie, Amore. It is a promise!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/50/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "That jacket... la giacca... it's been a part of my look for such a long time. It's almost become a part of who I am!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-2/18/c-2/50/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Yes. Molto Bene. Grazie Amore, for asking!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I see. Can you tell me why, Amore?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really want to talk about myself, actually."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Then I will not ask again. If you do change your mind, I am here. There is nowhere I would rather be, whatever we talk about."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Truth or dare?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Truth."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dare!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you like me?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As a friend."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Moon and stars! My heart is a great fish, leaping from the icy water to taste the sun!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am so happy to hear that! Life is infinitely enriched with good friends to walk beside us."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...oof. I cannot deny, amo..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amic..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do not have word for you, for this... after all we have shared, after all we have learned?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-5/15/c-2/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "My sadness is the greater for having sprung upon me from the darkness. It is a wolf trap. I am ensnared."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I dare you to receive my hand in yours."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He reaches his hand out for yours."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cabrizzio... our hands fit perfectly!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I receive your hand gratefully, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah... no offense, but your hands look kinda gross."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Bellissimo! It's true, Amore mio!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Eccellente! These are the hands that you can always count on to support you!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Cabrizzio's hands are not gross. I am clean and orderly and elegant."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will offer you the doubt that you did not mean to insult me..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...though it certainly seems that you did. Hm. I confess... I feel such confusion now."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_encounter/0/truthordare/c-6/23/c-2/34
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "To call me gross..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Al cuore non si comanda. You can't rule the heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is a popular saying in romantic comedies."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I find it especially true right now."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The heart wants what it wants, no?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You watch romantic comedies?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mine certainly wants you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do. I love them! I would say it is a guilty pleasure, but for that saying to apply, I would have to experience guilt."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Which I do not. Guilt is a wasted emotion. Telly treats me to a good movie every now and then, and each occasion is the source of much celebration and excitement!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What can I say, I'm a piccolo sciocco for love, in all its expressions!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Your heart wants me, Amore? I can well believe it. My heart has been singing your name like a gondoliere."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Are you sure it is not just your eyes?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's my eyes, too. You are a pleasure to look at."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can it not be both?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Grazie, Amore. The pleasure of looking good is matched by the appreciation I see in your gaze."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore mio, you really do know how to flutter a cabinet's doors."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I can admit to you now that I have been trying to sweep you off your feet... but suddenly I am the one being swept!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I can truly say that I have not been this happy since... well, long ago."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you want to talk about it?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you are ready to talk about it, then I am eager to listen."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, whatever you like."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That makes me happy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must be sad a lot. That surprises me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you really wish to listen? As you know, this is not a subject I discuss often..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "In fact, when given the chance, I will talk about almost anything else. But there is something about you. There is something about this moment that tells me it might be time."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I might be alright. I might be safe to feel this again."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, Amore. You are kindness itself. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Hm. Forgive me... perhaps I was wrong."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Maybe now is not the right time. Please, forget this. Forget I said anything about it."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-4/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, I did not mean it that way."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-4/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, it's already forgotten."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-4/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Va tutto bene. I must have misunderstood."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-4/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Grazie."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am glad that it does. What is more beautiful than two happy people sharing the moment together?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "One cannot live life without experiencing joy and sadness."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you know what I find most enchanting about romantic movies?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, what?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably the costumes."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The characters go through so much. There are always the misunderstandings, the mistakes. Sometimes there is cruelty, too."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But no matter what, in the end, l'Amore vince. Love triumphs!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ha! Amore, your humor. I do often find the clothing quite diverting!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do enjoy fabric and texture and color. But my most favorite part is that l'Amore vince. Do you understand this?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-1/c-8/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Love always wins. Through all kinds of storms and circumstances, the love will prevail."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is no surprise that I find it romantic. But for me also, it is a comfort. No matter what the storms, the love is there. And it will be there when the clouds clear away."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is a truth of the cosmos."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Perhaps to some this will sound silly. But Amore... it sustains me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like romantic comedies, too, actually."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it's cute."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you? How wonderful! I love them all. Even the ones I have heard called cheesy, Amore. Even though, do you know, I do not like cheese at all... but I love these movies."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Cute. Hm. Perhaps I am misunderstanding this word... cute is a casual thing, yes? Like a puppy, or a small cactus?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/c-10/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes... but it's good. I meant it in a good way."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/c-10/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't get mad. I wasn't trying to offend you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course, Amore. I must be a bit tired, for some reason. Talking of my movies and romance... it gets to my heart, that is all."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, Amore. It would take so much more than this to make me angry. And it would take even more than that to make me angry at you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I know... I trust, that you do not mean to hurt me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore, do you see?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "We have just had a misunderstanding. Like in the comedies."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You know, Amore, at this point in the movie, one of the characters must offer a vulnerability. I..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...I would like it to be me. May I tell you a truth?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course you can. I am here with and for you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you're going to trauma dump on me then maybe not now?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/c-12/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Trauma dump. This means unload complaints or issues onto another without consent or welcome... correct?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/c-12/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "How could you think..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/c-12/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "No. No, I will not be dumping the trauma."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/c-12/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Perhaps this proposed vulnerability is too much."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/c-12/39
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Let us retreat back to an easier territory. I have asked too much..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_love/0/g-3/17/c-12/47
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is alright."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "There is a saying that goes something like, friends are the greatest treasure in life."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If I may be so bold... you, mi amici, are the great and shining treasure to me now!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is not to say that I do not have friends in the rest of the house. I do! I am friendly, and the intercourse between the objects here is a joy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But you are truly on a shelf of your own."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're easy to get along with."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, thanks! It's nice to be appreciated for something easy!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I think so, too! I have heard it said before that I am too passionate... I think even with you I may have let my zest and zeal get the best of me at times."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But these are things about myself that I would not change even if I could. Though I may not be the taste of some of the others..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amici, it honors me that you are here. That we are here together, with an understanding of each other."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're being too hard on yourself."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, sometimes you do get too passionate."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I may be my own harshest critic. But so many are! I think it's one of the great journeys that we get to learn how to love what we are, just as we are."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Grazie, amici, for this reminder."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "See? Even with you! Even with you, I can sometimes overflow the goblet. I understand."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Though I would not say that am \"too passionate\", I am just... passionate! There is no limit on what is the right amount of passion, or the wrong, too much, too little."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh dear. Hm. I am realizing now that I have not asked you..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-0/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I have told you what I think, how I feel... but I have not asked..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Easy? What is easy?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah! It is easy to be my friend, you are saying! Amici!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am dancing the tarantella in my feet, look at that!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What a pleasure to know you, amici."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ehhhh... it's more like you're leading and I'm being pulled along."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, it's easy. Like breathing."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Forgive me, I have confusion. You are being pulled. That means like an unwilling animal you are tied to the runaway cart that is Cabrizzio and you have no choice?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... a little bit? Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I totally have a choice... my choice is to go along for the awesome ride!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh my heart..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is such a strange feeling to know that the inside of you can feel. So often I think of the inside of myself just as an empty space, as a void."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Sometimes, to me, it is so empty that I forget about it. It goes away in my mind. And then something happens, and the nothing begins to ache."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "There is an ache now."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/39
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I have never meant to force you. Not into anything, not ever. Perhaps I saw more here than there was."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, you did."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm just picking on you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Picking on me. Ah, I see. You..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...you make a joke?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/47/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You make a joke about my deep feelings, and then pick even more at me when I am hurt and confused."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/47/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I... I don't know. Something is wrong now. The ache will not leave me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh Amici you are making fun!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You gave me such a fright! Hmph. I shall have to find some way to make your heart jump the way that mine has in the past few moments!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Like breathing. Mmm. Amici."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What could I possibly say to add to the power of this declaration? Like breathing. Mm."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/c-1/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Then we shall inspire together."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Do you think our friendship is a real one?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "A friendship that will stand the tests and rigors of time?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know it! Without a doubt."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The friendship is great. But, we might go a step further, I think..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. You're way too clingy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am overjoyed! Truly!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amici. May I dare once again call you... Amore?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. Please you dear sweet cabinet, call me Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No silly, I meant I wanted to be your BEST friend!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore mio! Si!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh! Well, yes of course. Though now you have reawakened the yearning within my shelves for that warmth and passion I initially felt for you..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I suppose I shall have to bear it!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "How lucky for me, it is such a pleasurable burden!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Clingy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Clingy. The way you say this... I do not even want to understand what you mean. The way you say this, your tone is breaking my heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_friend/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The scorn in your eyes... do not explain. Say not one more word to me. Please."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I know that I am imperfect. It is one of my joys to be imperfect! All great artistry is imperfect."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You are imperfect, too. I say this not to wound, but to inspire. To celebrate! How can you not see, the flaws are where the beauty of the universe penetrates our defenses, illuminates the gentle love within?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good lord. This is what I'm talking about. You're making me batty."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry. I didn't mean to offend you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Batty?? Amore, amici... whatever! Tell me. Are you truly a small, dark, flying thing with big ears and sharp teeth... and I haven't noticed??"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is possible I have misinterpreted. That can be a downside of the passionate nature, you see."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I may take things to heart too quickly."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But I can let it all go with as much ease! There is not room enough in me for all the past, all the history to stay. Some things must leave and I choose the things that have hurt me to go."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am strong, but I can only hold so much."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, and maybe I said some things I shouldn't have."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are pretty sensitive."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is natural, amici. Only natural."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If I have done any of the offending, please accept my apologies. I mean only to love."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Until I don't, of course! There is always a line. But we may step back from it, I think."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think so, too. We can still be friends right?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a line? Huh. I'd like to see you pissed off, actually."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course! I would want nothing more!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Would you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/31/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Quanto audace, amici. So you don't apologize, after all? And you want to see my anger. You truly want to feel it?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-0/31/c-1/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If you insist, amici, then it will truly be my pleasure to oblige you. After all, I have done nothing but since we met."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You say that as though it is something of which I should be ashamed. You say I'm pretty sensitive like \"you're pretty covered in strawberry jelly\" or \"you're pretty naked in a shopping mall.\""
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I tell you, if it is the genuine desire of my soul to be naked in a shopping mall covered from hinges to hasps in strawberry jelly, then I shall be!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Are you not my friend that you would shame me?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I would shame you! That's so weird!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. Of course I wouldn't. I'd be next to you covered in grape."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "We are not friends. We could never be. I feel a fool to have believed..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-0/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...but no. I believed what I believed then. And I am free to change my mind... which I do now."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-0/26
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I thought you understood me, amici."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well you thought wrong."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course we're friends. I'm just joking with you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah. Non sto ridendo. It means, I am not laughing."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You have a very dangerous sense of humor, amici."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You walk quite a fine line!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Although the image of two of us together, stark naked in a shopping mall, covered in jelly and uh..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...it goes a long way towards restoring my good mood!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/39
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Allora. I have decided."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I'm nervous..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/47/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Though you have teased me with your attitude, I shall be generous and fun loving. I call you friend."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/47/g-0/8 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_ending/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I hope that in the days to come and long into the future, we can discover all the highs and lows of life together."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/47/g-0/16 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_ending/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "No matter what may come, I will be here for you, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/47/g-0/24 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_ending/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If there is ever anything troubling you, come to Cabrizzio. We will sort it out!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_second_bad/0/c-1/39/c-1/34/c-1/47/g-0/35
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "To many long years of good tidings and fast friends!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Years ago, I lived with someone. I grew quite close to them."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/11
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The days we shared seemed to last forever. It was idyllic."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/19
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "They took loving care of me and in return I kept things organized. I expressed my love for them by creating a space that pleased, where the good feelings grew like flowers in the sun."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/27
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is still difficult to say... but this was my first love. A true love."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/35
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I was happy for a long time living in this arcadia."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But then..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But as we all know, change is the only constant... even the most perfect flower will eventually fade and wither."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It still burns in my heart to think they might not have known the depth of my love."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Given the chance, would I have done things differently? Would I have been braver, and told them? Would I have let them go at all? I truly do not know."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should have opened yourself fully."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you did the right thing."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-0/18/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're so handsome."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "When I say I have painful memories, I do not mean the pain is from someone hurting me. Or the pain of loving the wrong person; someone who would not love me back."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I loved them with my life. And then one day, they were gone. The moment has passed."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I wonder so often where they are now. How they are doing? Are they happy?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "There is so much unexpressed. So much I still carry that, in truth, is not mine at all. It belongs to them, this love. This gratefulness."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I never got to tell them thank you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go back!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you for sharing this..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore, I have not ever thought I would grow so fond of another again. I did not believe I had the room for such a glorious bloom to grow a second time."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But here you are. You are the spring after a long winter and..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...I could not go on without sharing this with you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is my past. It is so much of what I carry."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Thank you for listening."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Thank you for the chance to know you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you, Cabrizzio. For sharing. I really appreciate your story."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oof. That was more saccharine than an old candy bar."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You are too kind. It feels inevitable for me to tell you now..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "That I love you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love you, too. But I cannot help but wonder something."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lovers have to be honest..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This story sounds very familiar to me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like your story doesn't add up?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, nothing. Nevermind. Why worry when you can have fun, right?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Familiar?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, something about your past and your stories in general."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They have a tinge of familiarity."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah. That..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Yes. I might know why that is."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I have something to confess to you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-0/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go ahead. It's alright."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Add up? What is there to add? There's no numbers in this story, amici."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've found a couple instances where your history doesn't make a whole lot of sense."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am a cabinet. I am sexy. What is there that makes no sense?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well... cabinets can't ride scooters."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cabinets don't have human partners like in that picture."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were manufactured in Michigan. You've never been to Italy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Well, maybe not in this country. But in Italia..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Well, you're one to talk..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Michigan?? Michigan, ah, that sounds fun, I would love to go there! I am my own free spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And a cabinet can go on vacation from time to time!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Because... it is free!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mon..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/g-0/8/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh amici... fine. Here, the truth, la verita at last..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-7/26/g-0/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Precisamente, amici!!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "A cruel strike, indeed."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-8/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It has long fascinated me, how differently one can feel a blow."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-8/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "When my doors are closed, I can take anything. I am a gladiator in armor. Throw any missile, hurl any barb, it will roll off me like water jumping off a hot skillet."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-8/39
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But open, ah. Open. I do not know I shall ever be able to fully rid myself of the viscous muck of this carelessness."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-8/47
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I suppose I shall try..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_past/0/g-2/c-8/55
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But, with the lesson learned, I try alone."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/12
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This, my life, my stories..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/20
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...it is all from the movies that are near and dear to my heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/28
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I wish more than anything that I could travel and be worldly."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/36
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It has been such a deep and passionate dream of mine that I think I have gotten lost."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/44
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I have created a life that was never mine."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/52
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course part of it was that I so wanted to impress you. I have watched you, and you have fascinated me..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/60
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "...but it was never just about you. My spirit yearns for something more. My heart cries out for adventure, for espresso under the ancient archways and the music and the calling voices!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/68
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah Amore... my love... I am so sorry. Please, please understand."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/76/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do understand. But who you really are is wonderful, too."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/77/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So all of this is just made up. Plagiarising a bunch of movies."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Oh my love. I sing your praises until the world ends!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You must understand that none of this is intended to hurt you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "In so many ways, it was never about you at all."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It is a truth I feel deep down. It is something I know about myself."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "This is not a mask. I have lived these lives as though they were my own."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Cabrizzio. I cannot trust my heart to someone who isn't grounded."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course. I wouldn't ever ask it of you. I wouldn't want to trust my heart to someone that cannot understand how I have lived."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Perhaps we could be friends? Or we could try?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure. I'd like that."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know. You're just... you're not for me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Well then."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I had heard that hearts make a sound when they break."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Mine just sounds like a door. A closing door."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_confession/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ahhh yes I see. Either I am unapproachable and closed, which I think even you will agree is laughable, or I am too passionate!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "How is any one cabinet supposed to hold such contradictory truths? Not even truths. Judgments. They're placed on me like ill-fitting capes. They are clown shoes!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "If it were not for all the beauty in my world, I think I would've shuttered and rusted long ago."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But after everything, sono chi sono."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Sono chi sono when I am too much, sono chi sono when I am not enough, sono chi sono when I am wrong, when I am right, when I am beautiful or ugly or a joke or a hero."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/40
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I do wish you buona fortuna, amici. May the gods smile upon you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/48
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And thank you. Thank you for the laughter, for the adventure and the reminder."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/56
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Sono chi sono, amici. I wish you such confidence as that."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_path/64 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ciao."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_joiner/34
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "An open and shut case."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore mio, my heart is a field of wildflowers, swaying gently in the wind, tended to by the earth and sun."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I have always wanted a beautiful garden of my own, but to think that it might grow here, in my heart. To think that I could share such a private abundance with another, who sees the flowers in striking hues as I make them."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The infinite color and riotous beauty beams from me!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The way you have made me feel is unreal. This love will be my, our, masterpiece."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "To have the full beauty of the world, and exquisite you... my life reflects in on itself until I am blinded by how much I see."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/40
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore, you are eternally the brightest star in my sky."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/48
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ti amo."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ti amo..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am yours, Cabrizzio... but only as a friend. A true one, I hope."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amico mio! Ah."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I cannot say I will not pine. That the disappointment does not pierce my heart like a splinter."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "But the pleasure of knowing you at all soon heals me."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_ending/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I can pine as I will from the heights of the kitchen..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_ending/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Like a good wine, life is better shared with good friends."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_ending/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am so thrilled and honored to be yours!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_ending/43
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Buon appetito! To many long years of good tidings and fast friends!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "My friend! It is so good to see you! Tell me is there anything I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, just saying hello!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, could you listen a while?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/10/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/22/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Cabrizzio!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Molto bene! I wish you a wonderful day! Chase what you love, find what your heart yearns for then come back and we'll celebrate!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Of course! Tell me everything that is going on. We will roam the healing hills of Italia and sort it all out together."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Con affeto, amici!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_friend_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cabrizzio hangs on to your every word, and gives back tenfold in love and affection."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/4
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore mio, light of my life, it is wonderful to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/12 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/11
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Is there anything I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/20/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just wanted to tell you I love you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/21/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope, just came to stare at you."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/c-0/7 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And I love you. As the sun loves its garden. As the moon loves her sea. I love you as constant as gravity."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/c-0/15 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Until next time Amore! Ciao!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return/0/c-1/7 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Stare all you like Amore, because I can't help but sneak glances at you every chance I get."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're pleasantly surprised to see Cabrizzio has his jacket off. It's almost impossible to concentrate on what he's saying when you're face to face with that chest and those abs."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_true_love_return_nude/0/8/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore mio, light of my life, it is so wonderful to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/unveiling/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "You have asked for me to remove my garments."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/unveiling/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes... I did..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/unveiling/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "To your delight, Cabrizzio complies, shrugging off his jacket to reveal a perfectly sculpted torso. You could do your laundry on those abs."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/unveiling/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Behold."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, don't make me tell you again."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What we have shared, is, but there will be no more. I can offer you nothing beyond luck in all of your endeavors."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will return to the sun, where I can see and be seen."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't believe I never noticed... (USE EMPATHY CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Si?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How beautiful you are."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I know how beautiful I am..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How beautiful your inner world is. A paradise."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Mamma mia... I knew one day you would see."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I yearn to go back to when I was welcome in your confidence."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah. Well stated, amici. I..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will try. I can try. I owe it to myself, only, to accept the love when it is offered."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/b/1
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Welcome, amico."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26/b/1
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Welcome, amica."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/29/b/1
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Welcome, amici."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Let us wander together."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join/0/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join_nude/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Quanto glorioso... can it be?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join/0/8 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join_nude/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore. I know you have a humorous heart, but please, don't jest with Cabrizzio about this, the deepest, unspoken desire of his heart."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join/0/16 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join_nude/0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Are you sincere?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join/0/33/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join_nude/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I am. And I have everything I need to do it!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join/0/34/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join_nude/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am sincere! I don't have what I need quite yet, but I will soon!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join/0/c-1/10 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join_nude/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ai, Amore, if I thought I had pined before, it was nothing compared to this!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join/0/c-1/18 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_join_nude/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I shall think of nothing else until I behold your radiance once more!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return/0/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return_nude/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "There you are! I have nearly perished, so dearly I have counted each moment of your absence. Can we proceed? Is it time?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return/0/17/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return_nude/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's time. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return/0/18/s/0 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return_nude/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Almost. Not quite. Hold on!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return/0/c-1/10 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return_nude/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, but can I? These shelves have held so much, these doors contained a multitude... but they may crack and shatter under the strain of this possibility..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return/0/c-1/18 cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_return_nude/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore. For me. You must hurry!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "If there's anyone who will comfort us as we start this process, it's Cabrizzio."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Alora, become umano!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a cabinet, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "The most stunning man alive, the beating heart of Italia, Cabrizzio in the flesh for once and for all time... SONO VIVO!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cabrizzio tells no lies—this newly human man is not only absolutely stunning, but Italian with a capital I."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realized/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow! You look absolutely spectacular. Go live your life, my friend!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_realized/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn. And I thought you were hot as a cabinet..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Amore. Do you have any idea what this means?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "It means a lot of things, of course... my head is spinning with what I am capable of now, with the experiences I will have, the sensations I will enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I will drink wine. Imagine, Amore! Real, dark, wine like the blood of memories bottled and bursting open for me, a ruby intimacy, Amore!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wine. I love wine. Go for it."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cabrizzio... pour me a glass..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "More than wine itself... imagine this wine dripping onto your lips from mine. Imagine my hands upon your shoulders as you inhale the complexity. Imagine me massaging your neck..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "My fingers are moving slowly on your skin as the wine moves slowly through your blood and together we blur the lines between body and sensation."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "We no longer have to imagine this, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I have these hands. I have these strong fingers. I have a beating heart to press into your back as I hold you, arms to encircle you, a cheek to lay upon your head as I breathe you in..."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "What do you think, Amore? Shall we? Shall we, at last, be together in the full glory of our bodies?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want nothing so much as that."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yes. And no need to be too gentle, either!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And I, Amore. Let us take our time. We have forever, you see. This moment is our forever."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "And we will swim in it together."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Ah, Amore. I love this saucy spirit... you truly are the spice of my life!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cabrizzio takes his time with you, finally living out the romantic dreams he'd only been able to guess at in his favorite films. Like many Italians, he talks with his hands... and he is an <i>effective</i> communicator."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_divert/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not certain Cabrizzio will ever have his fill of you, nor you of him, but sunrise comes one way or another, and Cabrizzio assures you between tearful kisses he'll return to you again someday, Amore."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cabrizzio took his massive shoulders and his chiseled jaw line directly to the airport and boarded the first flight for La Bella Italia. He flew standby, and ended up with a middle seat between a very grumpy middle manager and a slightly crotchety, mostly sleepy Canadian."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "By the time they landed in Rome, the tax adjuster was teaching the whole section a drinking song from her days working at the Renaissance Faire while the Canadian scribbled furious notes on Cabrizzio's recipe for the perfect pomodoro sauce."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Needless to say, Cabrizzio fell in love the moment he stepped out of the airport. Everything he saw brought a tear to his eye, a song to his lips. He declared loudly and repeatedly that Roma, that Italia was the most perfect place in all the world."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He danced and swayed through the streets, and it wasn't long before he became almost as much of a tourist attraction on the streets of Rome as the streets of Rome themselves."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/35
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "My joy cannot be contained! I could not restrain myself even if I tried, but I would never try! Italia deserves my joy. I deserve my joy of Italia! We are together, Italia and I!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Tour Italy Bureau took notice. When their representative could weave her way between Cabrizzio's waving arms and flashing legs, she offered him a permanent position as a tour guide and representative of the best of Italian culture."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/54
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Can you believe it, Amore? They want me. I want Italia and Italia wants me right back! Could I ever be any happier than I am in this moment? I don't know... HOW, I ask? Italia may answer me, but for now, come for a tour of the most perfect city in the world!"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There was a development that the Tour Italy Bureau did not anticipate."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Cabrizzio, after each of his tours, asked his customers where they were going. They, quite understandably, replied that they were going home."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/78
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Home? You're... you're leaving Italia?"
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "So shocked and unmanned was he by this patently indefensible position, Cabrizzio began following his customers, whom he now thought of as family, to the airport."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/94
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The whole ride would be spent with him trying to understand their decision, convinced that they must be crazy, had not fully taken in what he had shown them, the passion that he had tried to instill in their hearts."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/102
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He followed them up to security, and with one poor couple from Thailand, he actually found his way through security and accosted them at their gate with fresh Bresaola, ricotta and a bottle of Chianti."
msgstr ""

#: cabrizzio_cabinet/cabrizzio_love_join/110
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He now spends his days giving tours, and his nights at the airport, bewailing the mistakes that all the departing passengers are making."
msgstr ""
